  triage:description "AK7-PLAN-QA-1 blocking finding: docs/plans/phase-ak/sprint-AK7-daemon-environment-neutrality.md (PR #733, commit bf2dd3d8 on plan/mvp-simplification) refers to a type named DaemonAutoStarter, which does not exist in the codebase. The real shared daemon auto-start boundary is DaemonSupervisor::spawn_daemon in crates/atm-daemon-client/src/lib.rs:824, called from spawn_and_wait_for_daemon at line 720. The issue has been corrected in commit f74c90ce." ;
